<%# Saccade, 2026-11-23: submission page header (admin view and the signer's "view document" page): Saccade logo, a small
    DocuSeal mark (attribution kept) and the document name at a normal size, instead of the 40 px DocuSeal logo next to a
    30 px title. Rendered inside the title link of submissions/show; the style below only touches that link.
    Modification of DocuSeal 3.3.8 (AGPL-3.0); source: https://github.com/warlock9k00/docuseal-saccade.
    The Saccade logo is its owner's trademark and is not licensed under AGPL. %>
<span id="saccade-sub-brand" class="flex items-center" style="gap:9px">
  <span class="flex items-center" style="gap:9px" role="img" aria-label="Saccade Media House"><img src="/saccade-media-house-logo.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="182" height="28" style="display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto"></span>
  <span aria-hidden="true" style="width:1px;height:20px;background:currentColor;opacity:.18;margin:0 4px"></span>
  <span class="flex items-center opacity-70" style="gap:5px">
    <%= render 'shared/logo', width: '16px', height: '16px' %>
    <span class="text-sm font-semibold">DocuSeal</span>
  </span>
  <span aria-hidden="true" style="width:1px;height:20px;background:currentColor;opacity:.18;margin:0 4px"></span>
</span>
<style>
  a:has(#saccade-sub-brand){gap:0;min-width:0}
  a:has(#saccade-sub-brand)>:not(:first-child){margin-left:0!important}
  a:has(#saccade-sub-brand) h1{font-size:20px!important;line-height:1.3;font-weight:600;color:#1E252D;padding-left:5px}
  @media (max-width:640px){#saccade-sub-brand .text-sm{display:none} #saccade-sub-brand img{width:auto!important;height:18px!important}
    a:has(#saccade-sub-brand) h1{font-size:17px!important}}
</style>
